<title>LEBANON: Lebanon bank assets up 0.18 pct in Jan - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanon bank assets up 0.18 pct in Jan - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total assets of Lebanon's banks rose 0.18 percent in February, the Lebanese Banks Association reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>The association issued the following banking sector details (in billions of Lebanese pounds, at end of period unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>		    Nov 96   Dec 96   Jan 97   Feb 97  Dec96/Feb97</p>
<p>Total Assets    35,784   37,183   37,326   37,394	0.57</p>
<p>Month change (%)  2.90    3.91     0.39     0.18</p>
<p>Deposits of Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		    29,870   30,685   30,883   31,290	1.97</p>
<p>Month change (%)  2.78    2.73     0.65     1.32</p>
<p>Claims on Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		    13,014   13,290   13,398   13,262     (0.21)</p>
<p>Month change (%)  3.18    2.12     0.82     1.02</p>
<p>Total capital    1,539    1,943    1,970    1,999	2.88</p>
<p>Month change (%)  9.83   26.30	1.37     1.49</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057 745308</p>
</text>
